MinutesOn modifications to flacenc 0.5.1 (2026-11-19)

Upstream: https://github.com/yotarok/flacenc-rs/
Original package: https://static.crates.io/crates/flacenc/flacenc-0.5.1.crate
Original package SHA-256: 74c892c2b5fa08f967e8b5ad29121570b4762202f2402033ce08479ec65eccd0
Published package VCS commit: 4e9e73ae9a5072bd3de904c4a516401f425fde07
Upstream license: Apache-2.0; the original LICENSE and source notices are retained.

This is a locally modified copy, not an unmodified upstream release.
Cargo.toml pins heapless to 0.9.4 to remove the dependency on affected heapless
0.8.0 (RUSTSEC-2026-0574 through RUSTSEC-2026-0582).
src/component/datatype.rs changes two error patterns from |()| to |_| because
heapless 0.9 returns CapacityError from Vec::from_slice. Error messages and
validation behavior are unchanged. No encoding algorithm is changed.

The independent upstream Cargo.lock, upstream Cargo configuration, and repository
maintenance files are omitted. The application workspace Cargo.lock defines the
actual dependency resolution. Cargo.toml.orig is retained verbatim as provenance
and is not the build manifest. Cargo.toml package metadata records provenance,
the two modified files, and the reasons for their changes. The dependency notice
inventory records the actual SHA-256 of those modified files.
